{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sternly Worded Adventures</strong> is a roguelite word puzzle RPG inspired by <i>Bookworm Adventures</i> where you travel through a forested peninsula with Yorkshire-sounding place names fighting monsters with the power of words to uncover whatever dark secrets may be lurking beyond.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master over <strong>10 different classes</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>15 different enemies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over <strong>250 items</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell words with over <strong>25 different letters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562130/extras/5de159cb515d03f4cbab0ab6c2ce543c.avif?t=1761592532\" width=765 height=93 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S IN THE DEMO?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo you are limited to the starting <i>Adventurer</i> class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play any combat node up to and including Level 3. Visiting a Level 4 node triggers an event that ends the demo. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have access to every item the adventurer could normally access except for one, which is restricted because it can trigger the afore mentioned event early.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have full access both of the <i>Wordle</i> and <i>Minesweeper</i> inspired minigames, without limit, and the same for the <i>suika</i> inspired minigame once you find it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can directly continue your save file from the demo in the full version.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2562130?t=1761592532","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562130/bd2a701ccdf447541e692bbdc65524f3dc9bb97b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761592532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562130/00ecf0b7fbdc8786be6e2e6a8033f7801384b672/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761592532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562130/00ecf0b7fbdc8786be6e2e6a8033f7801384b672/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761592532","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2570560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sternly Worded Adventures</strong> is a roguelite word puzzle RPG inspired by <i>Bookworm Adventures</i> where you travel through a forested peninsula with Yorkshire-sounding place names fighting monsters with the power of words to uncover whatever dark secrets may be lurking beyond.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master over <strong>10 different classes</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>15 different enemies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over <strong>250 items</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell words with over <strong>25 different letters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562130/extras/5de159cb515d03f4cbab0ab6c2ce543c.avif?t=1761592532\" width=765 height=93 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S IN THE DEMO?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo you are limited to the starting <i>Adventurer</i> class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play any combat node up to and including Level 3. Visiting a Level 4 node triggers an event that ends the demo. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have access to every item the adventurer could normally access except for one, which is restricted because it can trigger the afore mentioned event early.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have full access both of the <i>Wordle</i> and <i>Minesweeper</i> inspired minigames, without limit, and the same for the <i>suika</i> inspired minigame once you find it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can directly continue your save file from the demo in the full version.</strong></p>","developers":["Balthazar"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562130/748d02c7495b70be6875c10f2d2fa169ad184bf3/header.jpg?t=1761592532","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04, Ubuntu 18.04, and CentOS 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.1 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+, Vulkan capable.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> X 10.13 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 3000 512 MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2562130/598667/aac9492c497cf7f1a2d20a39a14fe5b74d647f39/1750931671/dash_av1.mpd?t=1692378079","dash_